      "raw": "[quote=\"Craig\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Silverleaf wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\"><strong>Pydro wrote:</strong><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Silverleaf wrote:<br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Pydro wrote:<br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">It can help other people searching if the issue is in the title, but people rarely do that.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></blockquote></blockquote>\nAnd then I request a title change, and Craig or someone changes the title. That&#39;s the usual way. ;)Well, if we have a system that is working, why change it.I REQUEST THAT CRAIG OR SOMEONE CHANGES THIS\n</blockquote></div>\nDone.&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWow. This did not just make me respect Craig even more, but dare i say, fear this new power? has he become omnipotent? What&#39;s next?! The country? The world? My tablet?! OH THE HUMANITY!\n",
